SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Retain 60 min cap at 110–125W but make 
 it conditional: only 
DESCRIPTION:Retain 60 min cap at 110–125W but make it conditional: only e
 xecute if both Tuesday cycling and Thursday easy run have been completed w
 ithout issue and body battery on Saturday morning is ≥55. If battery is 
 below 55\, replace with a 30 min flat walk.\n\nReason: Adding a conditiona
 l gate ensures the athlete does not push into a long ride too soon after i
 llness — self-reported slow return on 15 Aug means each session must be 
 earned by prior recovery markers.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
