SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Replace with 35–45 min easy jog at 6:45
 –7:15/km (HR ≤135 bpm
DESCRIPTION:Replace with 35–45 min easy jog at 6:45–7:15/km (HR ≤135 
 bpm) — approximately 5–6km. A near-3-hour long run one week after retu
 rning from serious illness is a significant injury and relapse risk\; rebu
 ild distance progressively.\n\nReason: 18.5km in week 1 of return from a 3
 .5-week illness is disproportionate\; a short easy jog protects health and
  still delivers the first real running stimulus of the comeback.\n\nAI coa
 ching 2026-08-15
